  "notes": "One record for the Phi-3 release with inline size variants (mini, small, medium). Phi-3-mini became available on 2024-04-23 (Azure AI Studio, Hugging Face, Ollama, NVIDIA NIM); Phi-3-small and Phi-3-medium were announced the same day and released at Microsoft Build on 2024-05-21. The technical report v1 was submitted to arXiv on 2024-04-22, one day before the Azure blog. The mini card now describes a June 2024 update (Release dates: June, 2024), treated as an alias-level update, not a new record. Phi-3-vision is a separate record. All three sizes appear on the Retired Microsoft Foundry Models page (retired 2025-08-30); the weights remain on Hugging Face under the MIT license, so lifecycle is available. Microsoft reported benchmark results."
